l font-bold tracking-tight">Agree a written price</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">We diagnose on site and write down the price: labor, standard parts and cleanup. The $129 call-out comes off it. Anything extra we find, we price separately and ask first.</p></li><li class="border-t border-line pt-6" style="--i:2"><span class="text-sm font-bold text-accent-ink tabular-nums">Step 3</span><h3 class="mt-2 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">We fix it and test it</h3><p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-muted">We pressure-test the repair, clean up and email the invoice with before and after photos. Labor is guaranteed for two years.</p></li></ol></div></section><section id="quote" class="py-16 sm:py-20 lg:py-24" aria-labelledby="quote-title" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz><div class="container-x" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz><div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr]" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz><div class="card-accent reveal flex flex-col p-7 sm:p-10 lg:p-12" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz><h2 id="quote-title" class="h-section quote-title" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz>Tell us what&#39;s wrong and get a <span class="hl">written price</span></h2><p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed font-medium opacity-80" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz>Add your address and, if you can, a photo. During opening hours we reply within an hour with a price range or a time to visit.</p><ul class="mt-8 space-y-3.5" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz><li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-semibold" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="icon shrink-0" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12.5l4.5 4.5L19 7.5"/></svg>Quotes are free</li><li class="flex items-center gap-3 font-semibold" data-astro-cid-ajlgvwkz><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="20" height="20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.